msgid "From developer.paypal.com: Apps & Credentials, create a REST API app (sandbox and live have separate apps)."
msgstr "З developer.paypal.com: Apps & Credentials, стварыце REST API app (у sandbox і live асобныя праграмы)."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:144 r2/templates/prefapps.html:148
msgid "secret"
msgstr "сакрэт"

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:147
msgid "In the app's settings, add a webhook for Checkout order approved, Payment capture completed, denied and refunded."
msgstr "У наладах праграмы дадайце webhook для Checkout order approved, Payment capture completed, denied і refunded."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:154
msgid "Buyers pay on Stripe Checkout with a card, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Link and any other method turned on in the Stripe dashboard (Settings > Payment methods)."
msgstr "Пакупнікі плацяць на Stripe Checkout карткай, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Link і любым іншым спосабам, уключаным у панэлі Stripe (Settings > Payment methods)."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:161
msgid "From the Stripe dashboard: Developers > API keys. sk_test_… for testing, sk_live_… for real payments."
msgstr "З панэлі Stripe: Developers > API keys. sk_test_… для тэставаньня, sk_live_… для сапраўдных аплат."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:164
