msgstr "У Developers > Webhooks дадайце endpoint для checkout.session.completed, checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded, checkout.session.async_payment_failed, checkout.session.expired і charge.refunded."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:171
msgid "Buyers pay in USDC (a dollar stablecoin) from Coinbase or any crypto wallet, through Coinbase Business checkouts. Coinbase Commerce, the old service, has shut down."
msgstr "Пакупнікі плацяць у USDC (даляравы стэйблкойн) з Coinbase або любога крыпта-кашалька праз Coinbase Business checkouts. Coinbase Commerce, старая служба, закрытая."

